Subject: [PATCH 57/57] fix(Raids/Yogg): Free trapped portal teammates before
 entering

A reserved healer remained in a Constrictor until after the portal window while the other team members entered. Let assigned damage dealers free trapped teammates with ordinary attacks and a route around Knock Away before using their portals. Cache the bounded team lookup for triggers and multipliers; preserve the admission, sanity and exit limits.
---
